@TodoListApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5133

### Get all TODO items
GET {{TodoListApi_HostAddress}}/api/todos
Accept: application/json

### Get a TODO item by ID
GET {{TodoListApi_HostAddress}}/api/todos/c247e4e5-2a94-4053-9271-e522490ab7a9
Accept: application/json

### Create a TODO item
POST {{TodoListApi_HostAddress}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete technical assessment"
}

### Delete a TODO item
DELETE {{TodoListApi_HostAddress}}/api/todos/c247e4e5-2a94-4053-9271-e522490ab7a9